        <div id="questions-7679843" data-guid="7679843" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679843_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Amended <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">10-17-1983</span> by <span class="loclaw">L.L. No. 6-1983</span></span>; <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">12-3-1984</span> by <span class="loclaw">L.L. No. 1-1985</span></span><a class="footnoteref" href="#ft7679843-1" id="ref7679843-1">[1]</a>; <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">7-1-1986</span> by <span class="loclaw">L.L. No. 5-1986</span></span>; <span class="legref" data-ref="LF2556287"><span class="hisdate">12-1-2025</span> by <span class="loclaw">L.L. No. 9-2025 (C-2025)</span></span>; <span class="legref" data-ref="LF2633569"><span class="hisdate">2-19-2026</span> by <span class="loclaw">L.L. No. 3-2026 (C-2026)</span></span>]</div><div class="para">The following elective officers of the City of Albany shall receive an annual salary in the following sums, respectively:</div><div class="codeTable lightGrayHead tableV2 defaultBorders #e0e0e0" style="border-color:#e0e0e0"><table class="lightGrayHead frame frameAll" style="border-color:#e0e0e0; " tabstyle="lightGrayHead"><colgroup><col style="width: 66%"></col><col style="width: 34%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight borderBottom" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:black;background-color:#d7d7d7;border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="bottom"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Officer</b></div></th><th align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderBottom" scope="col" startcol="2" style="color:black;background-color:#d7d7d7;border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="bottom"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Salary</b></div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Mayor</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$160,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Chief City Auditor</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$125,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Treasurer</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$125,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">President, Common Council</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$38,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">President Pro Tempore, Common Council</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$28,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Majority Leader, Common Council</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$28,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight borderBottom" startcol="1" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Majority Whip, Common Council</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderBottom" startcol="2" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$28,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry borderRight" startcol="1" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Member, Common Council</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" style="border-color:#e0e0e0;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$25,000.00</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7679843-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7679843-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: This local law was originally adopted by the City as L.L. No. 9-1984. Section 2 of this local law, which amended the salaries set forth in Subsection A of this section, read as follows:</div><div class="ftpara">§ 2. Commencing on September 1, 1985, and subsequent thereto, the annual salaries of the aforesaid City officials increase by a percentage which is equal to the percentage salary increase provided for nonunionized City of Albany employees.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
