        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679846" data-guid="7679846"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679846" data-guid="7679846" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679846_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Whenever required by existing provisions of law, the aforesaid increases in salary shall be subject to approval by the Board of Estimate and Apportionment.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
