        <div class="notes" id="notes-7679847" data-guid="7679847"></div>
        <div id="questions-7679847" data-guid="7679847" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7679847_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The provisions of § <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/SCC/74" target="_blank">74</a> of the Second Class Cities Law and the provisions of § <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/GCT/25" target="_blank">25</a> of the General City Law insofar as they restrict or are inconsistent with the provisions of this article are hereby, to that extent, superseded.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7679848 child"
      id="7679848"
